      "id": "six-months",
      "label": "Best of 6 Months",
      "mods": [
        {
          "id": 650004,
          "title": "FNF: SONIC JAM!",
          "description": "<h1><b>Welcome to SONIC JAM</b></h1><h2><b><i>JAMMIN' NEW WEEK</i></b></h2>Take on the World's Most Famous Hedgehog in WEEK SONIC, a 3-song original level with songs inspired by the rich soundtracks of <i>Sonic CD</i>, <i>Sonic R</i>,<i>Sonic Adventure</i>, and beyond! Revisit a classic locale, experience dazzling hand-drawn cutscenes, and rhyme at super-sonic speeds! Can you keep up?<br><br><h2><b><i>PLAYABLE SONIC CAMPAIGN</i></b></h2>Dr. Eggman's got a new path to world domination-- the POWER of MUSIC! Using his greatest creation, METAL SONIC, the Doctor's taking over the city's musical culture to harness its unlimited musical power. What's worse... is that they're convinced METAL SONIC is the REAL SONIC! But Sonic's not the slacker type. Take back the city's music and clear Sonic's name through intricately crafted 'Sonic Mixes' of FNF's unforgettable soundtrack. With 10+ remixes lovingly created from the ground up, you can check out a fresh, distinct take on Friday Night Funkin's music inspired by New Jack Swing, RNB, 90's House, Rock, Hip Hop, Chiptune, and many more. Face off against the worst of the worst, bring Metal Sonic's reign to an end, and free the spirit of music in Sonic's campaign.<br><br><h2><b><i>GO FOR PERFECT</i></b></h2><span class=\"SelectedElement\">When you're playing as Sonic, simply hitting all the notes won't be enough for those brag-worthy P ranks. On top of beating a song flawlessly, you'll need to style on your enemies with a brand new taunt system. After hitting a combo, you'll be able to chain taunts to the rhythm until your next turn. Pull off a sweet chain, and you'll get crazy bonuses that'll shoot you straight to the top! Every SICK note you hit gets added to your SCORE, so be sure to rack up enough for a massive score bonus at the end. Make a name for yourself on the charts as the most stylish MC alive!</span><br><br>",
          "author": "DingusCola",
          "image": "https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/800-90_697e98f2a2968.jpg",
          "likes": 554,
          "downloads": 150952,
          "views": 67074,
          "publishedAt": 1769918333,
          "updatedAt": 1772032782,
          "url": "https://gamebanana.com/mods/650004",
          "engine": {
            "id": "vslice",
            "name": "Base Game",
            "icon": "vslice.png"
          },
          "category": {
            "id": 29202,
            "name": "Base Game Mod Folders"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 653229,
          "title": "Friday Night Funkin': Remnants",
          "description": "What is <b>Funkin' Remnants?</b> It started out as a gimmick account on Twitter that's dedicated to archiving old content for Friday Night Funkin'!<br><br>Now we've developed a fully fledged remix mod for the game which features many unused elements that have been covered on Funkin' Remnants Socials before.<br><br>It also has a pretty nice wireframe style that tries to recapture the simpler vibes of other popular remix mods from back in the day. Neat ain't it?<br><br>Sing against your wireframe self in a space between dimensions and then play as them through Character Select to experience about <b>35 bangin' remixed tracks! </b>There's lots to see...<br><br><b class=\"SelectedElement\">THIS MOD WORKS FOR V-SLICE 0.8.4! IF THE MOD STOPS WORKING ON ANY LATER RELEASES WE'LL BE SURE TO UPDATE THE MODPACK AGAIN!</b><br><br><i>Developed by The Funkin' Remnants Crew (2026)</i>",
